 "description": "Read an online store's products, prices and availability, and what changed since its previous daily snapshot. Use it for questions like \"track competitor prices on allbirds.com\", \"what did gymshark.com change?\", \"did this store drop prices?\", \"what is new or sold out at this store?\". Pass store web addresses, up to 5. Works for stores on Shopify that publish their public product feed (/products.json). The store is added to a daily snapshot list, so its history builds up. Optional filters: query (text in a product's title, brand or type), limit. Returns per store the snapshot date, product count, currency, counts and lists of new products, removed products, price changes and availability changes per variant, and matching products with price, variants and availability. The first snapshot of a store has no changes to compare with.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "limit": {
    "description": "Most products listed per section (default 10)",
    "maximum": 25,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "query": {
    "description": "Only products whose title, brand, type or handle contains this text, such as \"hoodie\"",
    "maxLength": 200,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "stores": {
    "description": "Web addresses of online stores, such as \"allbirds.com\" or \"https://www.gymshark.com\". At most 5.",
    "items": {
     "maxLength": 300,
     "minLength": 1,
     "type": "string"
    },
    "maxItems": 5,
    "minItems": 1,
    "type": "array"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "stores"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
